Simplifies rpcCvtTable to make it easier to keep updated as the RPC interface changes.

This also does more error checking on the client side (does the operation exist, is the number of arguments in the expected range) and catches a lot of bugs other than the `asOfHeight` case that this fix is ostensibly for:

- `submitblock` didn’t convert its optional (but ignored) second arg;
- `z_getpaymentdisclosure` docs claimed all the args were strings, but two are actually ints;`
- `listreceivedbyaddress` didn’t convert the optional `includeImmatureCodebase`;
- `listsinceblock` didn’t convert the optional `includeRemoved` and `includeChange`;`
- `gettransaction` didn’t convert `verbose`;
- `listunspent` didn’t convert `includeUnsafe` or `queryOptions`;
- `z_getbalanceforviewingkey` didn’t convert `minconf`; and
- a minor non-bug – `z_getbalanceforaddress` had a handler even though the
  operation has been removed.

Fixes #6429.

`wolfsentry/wolfsentry_settings.h`: define `__wur` (warn_unused_result macro), and include it in the `WOLFSENTRY_API` definition; add `WOLFSENTRY_API_VOID` macro;

`Makefile.analyzer`: fix coverage recipe; use `$TMPDIR` as build parent if set; add `static-build-test`;

`examples/notification-demo/log_server/log_server.c`: clean up `ssl_shutdown` code in `main()`;

`src/actions.c`: fix retval testing in `wolfsentry_action_list_append_1()`, `wolfsentry_action_list_prepend_1()`, and `wolfsentry_action_list_insert_after_1()`; fix `wolfsentry_action_list_insert_after()`;

`src/events.c`: in `wolfsentry_event_drop_reference()`, clear subevent pointers as they are dropped, to assure no invalid pointers if error return before/during drop of parent event; in `wolfsentry_event_delete()`, delegate dropping of subevents to `wolfsentry_event_drop_reference()` to deduplicate code and fix potential use-after-free;

`src/json/centijson_value.c`: implement `json_value_clone()`; implement `malloc_rbtree_stack()`, and refactor `json_value_dict_clean()` to use it rather than `RBTREE_MAX_HEIGHT` pointers on the stack (in a recursively called function no less);

change `json_value_fini()`, `json_value_array_clean()`, `json_value_dict_clean()`, and `json_analyze_number()`, to return `int`s, and refactor globally to catch returned errors;

`src/kv.c`: fix `wolfsentry_kv_clone()` to call `json_value_clone()` for `WOLFSENTRY_KV_JSON`;

`test_dynamic_rules()`: add coverage of `wolfsentry_event_get_config()`, `wolfsentry_event_update_config()`, `wolfsentry_event_delete()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_append()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_prepend()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_insert_after()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_list_start()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_list_next()`, `wolfsentry_event_action_list_done()`;

`wolfsentry/wolfsentry.h`: add convenience macros
`WOLFSENTRY_THREAD_HEADER_CHECKED()` and `WOLFSENTRY_THREAD_TAILER_CHECKED()`;

`FreeRTOS/include/FreeRTOSConfig.h`: fix `configASSERT()` definition.

- new "extras" column;
- new "display page title" checkbox field;
- confirmation popup when deleting a page (edit page & page list);
- catch exceptions on update/create & show them in an error message;
- improve page name validation (bugfix - when the editing page was opened with the slug and not the ID);
- bugfix - delete button not shown when there were errors;
- new tests.

replaces: https://github.com/altair-viz/altair/pull/2610
fix: https://github.com/altair-viz/altair/issues/2608

